":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708059,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4MDU5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:2d","name":"topic:2d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-06-06T07:21:59Z","updated_at":"2025-06-30T09:55:05Z","closed_at":"2025-06-30T09:55:00Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n​​Labels​​: bug, rendering, 2D\n\n​​Platform​​: All (tested on Windows/Linux)\n\n\n\n### System information\n\n​​Godot Version​​: 4.4.1-stable\n\n### Issue description\n\n​​Description​​\nWhen using a SubViewport to render a 2D minimap, if a TileMapLayer has ​​Y-sort enabled​​, it is erroneously rendered even when ​​outside the SubViewport's visible area​​. This causes visual corruption in the minimap display.\n\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nCreate a 2D scene with a TileMap node.\nEnable Y-sort on the TileMapLayer.\nAdd a SubViewport as a minimap container.\nObserve that TileMap tiles outside the SubViewport bounds are still rendered.\n​​Expected Behavior​​\nOnly tiles within the SubViewport's visible area should be rendered.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n\n​​Actual Behavior​​\nTiles with Y-sort enabled are rendered regardless of SubViewport boundaries, distorting the minimap.\n\n​​Workaround​​\nTemporarily disable Y-sort on layers used in minimap SubViewports (not ideal for gameplay logic).\n\n​​Proposed Fix​​\nRequest to patch rendering logic in RenderingServer to respect SubViewport bounds for Y-sorted TileMapLayers.\n​​Priority​​: High (breaks minimap functionality).","closed_by":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107201/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107201/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"not_planned","pinned_comment":null}